WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.670
Narrator: Look and listen for the danger signs.

2
00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:03.880
Narrator: Pushing from behind.

3
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:06.260
Narrator: The crowd swaying in waves.

4
00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.470
Narrator: Shouting, screaming, people calling for help.

5
00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:12.720
Narrator: Frightened faces, children being lifted up.

6
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.690
Narrator: People climbing over barriers to get out.

7
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:21.080
Narrator: The flow slowing and stopping.

8
00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.030
Narrator: Someone falling.

9
00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:27.730
Narrator: Any one of these - report it now.

